= blue slice", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "features.0.weight[0, 0, :, :]\n                  |  |  \\ all 3 rows and 3 columns\n                  |  \\ input channel 0 = RED\n                  \\ output filter 0\n\n[0,1,:,:] = green slice; [0,2,:,:] = blue slice", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "features.0.weight[0, 0, :, :]\n                  |  |  \\ all 3 rows and 3 columns\n                  |  \\ input channel 0 = RED\n                  \\ output filter 0\n\n[0,1,:,:] = green slice; [0,2,:,:] = blue slice", "roundness": null}, {"id": "zeros", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1160, "y": 185, "width": 1180, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520005, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 225731611, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "yPkjHeCo", "type": "text", "x": 1190, "y": 210, "width": 1120, "height": 35, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520006, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2106048277, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Three different meanings of zero", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Three different meanings of zero", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Three different meanings of zero", "roundness": null}, {"id": "iIeIaU1c", "type": "text", "x": 1190, "y": 270, "width": 1100, "height": 125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520007, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1327966395, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a7", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "INDEX 0: selects filter 0 or channel 0.\nPADDING 0: temporary missing neighbor beyond an image edge.\nPOST-ReLU 0: a negative calculated response replaced by max(0,z).\n\nThese are not the same thing.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "INDEX 0: selects filter 0 or channel 0.\nPADDING 0: temporary missing neighbor beyond an image edge.\nPOST-ReLU 0: a negative calculated response replaced by max(0,z).\n\nThese are not the same thing.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "INDEX 0: selects filter 0 or channel 0.\nPADDING 0: temporary missing neighbor beyond an image edge.\nPOST-ReLU 0: a negative calculated response replaced by max(0,z).\n\nThese are not the same thing.", "roundness": null}, {"id": "hrWqCXKV", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 465, "width": 2280, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520008, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2026443893, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a8", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "B. Center position (row 1, column 1): all 27 real products", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "B. Center position (row 1, column 1): all 27 real products", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "B. Center position (row 1, column 1): all 27 real products", "roundness": null}, {"id": "DYasyYod", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 515, "width": 2280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520009, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 592992603, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a9", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "The center window covers the whole 3x3 image. Each grid cell multiplies the weight at the SAME row and column.\nWeights come from model.features[0].weight after seed-7 initialization; they do NOT come from the pixel values.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The center window covers the whole 3x3 image. Each grid cell multiplies the weight at the SAME row and column.\nWeights come from model.features[0].weight after seed-7 initialization; they do NOT come from the pixel values.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "The center window covers the whole 3x3 image. Each grid cell multiplies the weight at the SAME row and column.\nWeights come from model.features[0].weight after seed-7 initialization; they do NOT come from the pixel values.", "roundness": null}, {"id": "channel-0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 570, "width": 700, "height": 700, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 520010, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 536395221, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1789548934402, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aA", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "hasTextLink": false}, {"id": "ZdCOpBXC", "type": "text", "x": 85, "y": 595, "width":